      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: delivery report\n\nTwilio reports back here for every text and call. No passwords in this workflow: the Twilio check is done by Supabase (token in Supabase Vault).\n\nAfter pasting: open **Check Twilio signature** and **Save Status**, pick the Supabase credential, then **Publish**.",
